{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_7_level_main_07-03_beg","groupId":"main_7","stageId":"main_07-03","title":"并肩之约-1","storyCode":"7-4","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"12cbfd6e98dd0d80e33af5f45c1e3edb7de2dd3bb5ea2c7ceff007c34765dc89","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"narration","text":"罗德岛舰桥 6:00 a.m."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位优秀的干员们，现在开始，我会向罗德岛全舰通报一些重要的信息。这里是阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛本舰已经在昨天晚上正式驶离了龙门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们和龙门签订的长期贸易协定因为种种原因，已经失效。现在我们已经没理由继续在这座城市停留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一方面，罗德岛在龙门购置了足够的资源，这应该能让我们多支撑一些时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"另一方面......我们中的一些干员，将会在不久后深入切尔诺伯格核心城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一场更加艰巨的战斗正在那里等着我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......很多人可能会觉得，战争离我们很远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"战争，好像是种国家与国家之间的对抗，与一家制药企业没什么关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但战争......战争，我想战争从没离开过我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们早就身在一场战争中了。那是一场对感染者极度不公，会让所有人都相互仇恨的漫长战争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为了让抗矿石病药物成功研发，让感染者有机会使用这种药物，医疗干员们在理论与实验中都投入了大量的精力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"尽可能地让矿石病患者在罗德岛接受先进的抑制性治疗，同时减缓矿石病的扩散和发展，也一直是我们的行动标的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可这远远不够。在这之前，感染者和普通人之间的矛盾正在不断加剧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"敌视感染者的人不希望感染者得到救治，他们犯下的每一桩针对感染者的恶行，都增加了感染者与普通人间的不信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而另外一些人，利用感染者，奴役感染者，感染者只是他们的利益牺牲品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有人仅仅因为我们在研发治疗矿石病的药物，就与我们敌对，甚至攻击我们......这样的事情，我们遭遇过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果......如果我们研发出了药物，却再也没有机会将这种药物交付给感染者使用，那又会是什么样的光景？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们的敌人远不仅仅是“矿石病”。我们也已经没办法从这场战争里安然脱身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"两个星期前，整合运动与我们罗德岛发生了暴力冲突，有许多干员牺牲在了切尔诺伯格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......这种事已经在我们的身边发生过太多次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果每一次的牺牲都迫使我们转身复仇，那我们就有无数的仇要去报，将有无数的人......会被杀死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"被敌人杀死，被我们杀死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们与整合运动间的争执，本不该建立在仇恨上。在能与对方谈判的情况下，我们会要求对方为他们的行为作出解释，承担责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但到现在为止，整合运动依然没有自他们的疯狂行为中清醒过来。现在，他们正操作着切尔诺伯格核心城，冲向龙门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"更诡异的是，乌萨斯并没有放弃对核心城的领土控制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯依然把切尔诺伯格核心城看做自己的领土，哪怕它现在被整合运动操控着，哪怕乌萨斯从来没有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕乌萨斯从来没有对整个事件做出任何反应。切尔诺伯格这座城市里发生了种种可怕的事，乌萨斯帝国对此视而不见，也没有采取手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......那可是它们的国民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我认为，这次冲突背后隐藏着乌萨斯的阴谋。核心城的冲撞一定会带来国家与国家的战争。一旦乌萨斯和炎开战——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"到那时候，做什么都太晚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"无论整合运动的背后有多少隐情、多少隐形的推力，无论罪魁祸首是谁，只有一个事实会被冷酷地摆在我们面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——“感染者挑发了这场战争。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"无论谁赢得了战争的胜利，感染者都是仇恨矛头指向的目标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感染者面临着的，是比现在更严苛的压迫，更加艰苦的生存环境，还有......永远无法被消解的仇恨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那样的话，我们罗德岛根植的土壤就会消失。这片大地上的各个国家，将不允许我们治疗感染者，不允许他们获得正常的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的......这也是我们和矿石病的漫长战争中，无法逃避的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，罗德岛一直身在这场战争。这场战争，我们很难取胜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就算这样，我们也不可能认输。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们会用理智去对抗狂热，用巧妙的战术去战胜敌意，我们不可能放弃，因为我们没人希望最后只有一个不幸的结局等着我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我们要阻止整合运动，我们要去阻止切尔诺伯格核心城与与龙门城的冲撞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"希望留舰的各位照顾好罗德岛。不管我们能不能回来，罗德岛都会坚持到最后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。一切照常运行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"咻......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"说得好！","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，嗯，谢谢博士夸奖！"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，唔？博士，我脸上，有什么东西吗？不会是......面包屑吧？"}]},{"label":"你演讲的样子很迷人。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？！欸？！"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"会不会悲观了些？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，也有干员以前和我们这么说过。他们说，在这个时候，要鼓励大家，激发他们的志气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我慢慢发现，我们并不是那种团体。我们没有那么、那么需要昂扬的斗志，我们需要的是，对自己行为的理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"越是困难的时候，越应该把最真实的情况告诉大家，否则，我们的选择就会是盲目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么会比遮着眼睛在大地上行走更危险呢......？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我听说陈长官离开了龙门。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的。这次，陈长官应该会一个人潜入切尔诺伯格核心城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门城，感染者，血缘关系......陈长官的身上纠结着许许多多的矛盾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是这样沉重的负担，她也没有放弃，没有逃走，她带着它们走向了切尔诺伯格核心城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"背叛，离乡，死亡......她都不害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，陈长官是感染者。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"什么？！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"啊......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我就知道是这样。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我们罗德岛去核心城的同时，也会尽力去援助她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不仅是因为她......不仅是因为陈长官已经算是我们的朋友，也并不完全因为这是龙门某位人物的私人委托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陈长官不会独自面对整合运动。我们会和她一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"她努力去维护的东西，她苦熬至今的沉默......我们去帮助她，是为了我们愿望里相似的部分。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"太好心了点吧？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我以为你会有点害怕那个铁娘子。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，哈哈，博士的表情......真有趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前怀疑过陈长官她，也想着她是我们无法改变的那种人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，当她向感染者伸出援手的时候，我看到了，我看到了她心灵的颜色。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我头次听这种说法。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"这样的形容挺有趣的。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，唔，就，就是一种形容啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道怎么和别人描述我看到的东西......直接传输给别人也很不礼貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但在移动城市中保护感染者，坚持这种信念是一件......壮举。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陈长官绝不是一个冷血无情的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"也许她铁面无私，但正因为如此，她的正义感会促使她起身与灰暗的大地战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"即使她从来都不这么说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我们要去。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"没问题，我也和人约好了要去！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"好。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"也有人希望我去阻止整合运动。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......Dr.{@nickname}，难道是在说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......霜星小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，米莎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我们还能做些什么，能阻止米莎悲剧的重演，能宽慰霜星小姐和她的战士们，还有什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"还有什么是能帮助到更多人，阻止这片大地生产更多悲哀的事，我们去做。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"资料已经发给两位了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，将是我们三个人第一次共同指挥。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你会和我配合吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我该不该表现得更兴奋一些？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你也可以选择不去。这是你的个人选择，我无权改变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......凯尔希医生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我在听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望凯尔希医生能抛弃对Dr.{@nickname}的成见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我也希望Dr.{@nickname}别因为凯尔希医生之前的言语......对她产生成见。暂时放下也可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}失去了记忆。在短短两个星期内，罗德岛没有可靠的方法让博士重拾记忆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"所以博士现在所拥有的，都是新的理解，新的认知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生，我希望你用现在的眼光去看待现在的Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，我也想你别因为凯尔希医生现在说的那些话就怀疑她的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"她是你最值得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......依靠的人。不管你是不是相信她，她都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"请两位都答应我。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我还能怎么样？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我似乎没得选。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我们没有尽释前嫌这个选项，道德不能使我们这样的人变成更好的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"医生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有拒绝你提议的意思，阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，纯粹善意的宽恕，以及放弃自己愤怒的权力，只是让我们变得无限软弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我会一直保留这种权力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不过现在，我会搁置我的偏见，我们先去解决核心城这件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"彻底地解决它。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅，我站在你这边。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不不，没有！我不是觉得不好啦！其实是我......我有点，唔，我还有点反应不过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......我相信博士会在最关键的时刻协助我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过，以前的我想着的，是让博士来指导我，在这些最困难的时候，做到那些我办不到的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我也会变得更勇敢，只要博士在我身边。以前我就是这么想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，唔......医生，我没事。我知道的，我现在已经不会那么依靠别人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是博士，只是对博士......我原本真的是这么想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，博士，我们是肩并着肩了。从和你重逢开始，我就一直想找个机会，告诉博士，告诉博士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我长大了。我已经不用博士，凯尔希医生和......唔......遮风挡雨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我会用成绩回应博士的信任。一定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"欸！肩并肩是形容啊，不可以说我矮！我还在长个子！......唔！！我很快就会长得和博士长得一样高了，肯定！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......我只是很高兴，博士。嗯。只是......很高兴。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PRTS","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我感觉这里冷场了。需要我把指挥室的温度调高一些吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士想保留自己的观点，并没有任何问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不希望强迫博士把想法说出来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道的，我们......我们每个人都有自己的空间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，博士，哪怕只是给我一点点帮助......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅。没必要示弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}有擅长的事，也有不擅长的事。能力需要自行复苏的时间，Dr.{@nickname}也会在正确的时候做出正确的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"这个人不会忘记从苏醒直至现在发生在自己面前的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——如果我真的可以这么期待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生，这么说也太伤人了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士不爱说话，只是博士不愿说多余的话。博士会直接抓住问题的核心，是吧？"}]},{"label":"凯尔希，合作愉快。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你愿意的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我没想过你会这么爽快地答应，甚至有理由怀疑你在语句里设下了什么陷阱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......但又何妨呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}。合作愉快。"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们有什么计划？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，嗯......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，博士是想问哪方面的计划呢？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"首先要有进核心城的办法。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"怎么去？","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"要直接走到塔露拉面前说“你好”，对不对。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛确实有属于罗德岛的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"请对照报告书。我会解释计划的每个部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"4小时后，我们将在切尔诺伯格核心城的必经之路附近引发一场小规模的沙暴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"narration","text":"10:00 a.m. 荒野"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"1号！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"1号抽压机通电完成！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"2号！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"2号弹仓已经准备完毕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"3号。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"3号风仓，迷彩已经......已经遮盖完毕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"迷彩会有用吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"切尔诺伯格核心城的指挥塔视野很广，没伪装手段是不行的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"......把核心城当成军舰设计，甚至都不屑掩饰自己的想法，帝国在赤裸裸地宣扬暴力和征服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，原来乌萨斯帝国的设计还有这种倾向？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"设计催生想法，想法又反过来影响设计。他们乌萨斯人生活在这种环境，肯定会对外界充满敌意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......这么说对普通的乌萨斯居民是不公平的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......呃......我，我去拿下备用线......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，乌萨斯在我的故乡犯下了多少罪？多到他们连自己的手都洗不干净。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"现在他们又想借感染者的手挑起新的战争，更残忍地加害感染者，难道这还不能说明乌萨斯的暴虐吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"他们把田地烧光，拿碳灰把蓄水池填满，整个村子都在燃烧，被烤焦的尸体到处都是......土地被毁了，剩下的只有废墟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是我知道的乌萨斯人。如果不是乌萨斯居民支持了战争，这些事就不会发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"我的一己之见——那并非是乌萨斯人的集体意愿，相反，只是种邪恶想法的展现。我们不伤害乌萨斯人。我们只是对抗邪恶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"守林人，即使这一次我们并没站在卡西米尔的土地上，但你所说的，我们不会让它在我们面前重演。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"这与敌人是不是乌萨斯并无关系。整合运动也许把自己看作是乌萨斯人，也许不，但我们不是去伤害他人。我们是要阻止他们去伤害他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"......骑士从没帮过我们游击队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"我的队长和副队长等了那么多年，但等到最后，援军也没有来。只有我们自己战斗到最后一刻，战斗到被乌萨斯吞噬，只有几个人活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"我能相信谁？相信乌萨斯人其实心地善良吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有怪罪你们骑士，尤其是......怪罪你的意思，临光。我只是想起了和乌萨斯战斗的时光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"我不相信乌萨斯，也不相信卡西米尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"这是卡西米尔骑士的错误。骑士们没可能弥补错误，也不能真正守护好卡西米尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"但今天的我们可以并肩作战，守林人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"过去的我没有帮助你的机会，这一次，我们战斗。我们战斗，不为了我们的祖国，只为阻止乌萨斯的暴行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"即使我们这次只做支援工作，但我也做好了准备。为信仰而战，为你而死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"为别人而死......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"骑士不都像你这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"但我相信骑士就应该如此。为他人而死是有意义的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"守林人小姐，请允许我用这一次战斗向你表达歉意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"......干员临光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么需要我去做的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"让我们在仪器开始全速运转前，守住这片区域。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"narration","text":"4小时前"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这就是我们的伪装？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"所以我们已经选好了一种隐蔽方式。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"历经了多次重大武装冲突事件，隐秘登城几乎是干员的必修课了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然每次的情况都不同，但利用地形地势伪装自己，却一直是必须的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"有时候是在皑皑雪地，有时候在草原，还有时候在沼泽......我们用的方法都不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"现在龙门城所在的位置被沙漠和荒地包围，通过沙尘去掩盖踪迹，是最方便高效的办法。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我不觉得这能行。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"还不够。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"完全依靠这个战术是不明智的吧？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"这只是一种隐蔽我们踪迹的方式。罗德岛不会实施任何单线单向的行动。一次成功的潜入，需要种种已经完备的条件去支持。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿撒兹勒诊所带给我们的资料，验证了我手上切尔诺伯格工程图纸的真实性，我们对核心城下层结构已经有了相当的把握。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"届时，我们将从核心城的排水与基础工业部分进入核心城。但与此同时，我们还需要诱饵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"没有诱饵，猎物不会上钩。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"对猎人也一样。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......对。是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"随着时间推移，最拙劣的猎人也能分辨出猎物与诱饵的不同。我们要在他们识破我们之前避开他们的视线。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_aircraft"},{"type":"narration","text":"10:00 a.m."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这次作战不需要我们实地降落，对吗教官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"核心城地势不好，看上去整合运动的装备也不差，术师的数量更是不少，降下去估计要费些事儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"不需要，只需要摆出一副要登陆的样子，在核心城上空盘旋段时间就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"再说我们没带战术小队，只我们两个下去没什么用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"对啊，我怎么没想到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......这种安排怎么会没想到......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"开，开个玩笑，玩笑。教官不要对我这么凶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......你和“坏家伙”上那个谨小慎微的小伙子比，实在是太大大咧咧了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"半小时左右，没问题吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"绝对没问题！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"要足够引人注目！虽然废城的整合运动知道我们用过飞行器，但核心城的这些敌人，我们可不知道他们有没有得到消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，这架“好男孩”号，可比“坏家伙”显眼多了！半小时之内，绝对让他们挪不开视线，教官你就看我的吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"还是小心为好，可别被打下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"大可放宽心啊教官，我带着阿斯卡纶和煌，那么多次低空飞行也从来没被人打下来过！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......一旦被打下来就没有下一次了啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_perimeter"},{"type":"narration","text":"10:00 am  核心城外围"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"天上那个......是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"居然在天上飞？！是敌人的新武器吗！是哪个国家派来的？别管了，射击，快射击！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道那东西里面装了什么，千万别让它落地！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"别惊慌！只要它敢下降，我们就能把它炸开！别让它躲到我们看不见的地方就行！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_aircraft"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"这艘飞船有什么安全设施？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你恐高吗教官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"有一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不用担心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦出事的话，大家都来不及反应的，要是坠毁了铁定尸体都不剩，大家都一样的啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"我能不担心吗？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，我们已经成功吸引了敌人的注意力，让他们认为我们准备从空中降落，你们立刻开始行动！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"作战干员，注意！有稀散的敌人正在向我们的方向靠近，很可能是敌城市的先遣侦察部队！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"装置正在运转中，不能让他们干扰到我们的计划。守林人小姐，掩护我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"守林人","speakerId":"char_158_milu","isRemote":false,"text":"知道！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","aliases":["整合运动术师"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜宾"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["临光"]},{"speakerId":"char_158_milu","aliases":["守林人"]}]}
